// NT1 — Watch › Ideas › My ideas + Journal › Reviews
// New subcollection users/{uid}/ideas_my/{id}. NOT deployed by the NT1 branch — paste this inside the existing
// `match /databases/{database}/documents { match /users/{uid} { … } }` block of the Firestore rules (next to the `ideas` rule) and publish.
// Until it is there the My ideas view shows "Could not load My ideas (permission-denied) · Retry" (the AI generated side is unaffected).
match /users/{uid}/ideas_my/{doc} {
  allow read, write, delete: if request.auth != null && request.auth.uid == uid;
}
